This ISO is built for LineOS, a Linux distribution based on Arch Linux.

LineOS Sources:
https://github.com/Line-Incorporated/lineiso

Arch Linux Source:
https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/archiso

Calamares as our installer:
https://calamares.codeberg.page

Live environment will start now and let you install LineOS to disk, or try the KDE desktop from the Live Session.

This ISO is intended for testing and installation, and can be used to install LineOS on real hardware.

Please note the following about the Live environment:

- The Live session runs entirely from the ISO; changes to packages or system settings cannot be saved.
- Hardware or driver support in the Live session may be limited.
- The Live ISO is not intended for daily use.

